;Description
:A simple notice box.
;Syntax
{{t|Notice|v1=tone=color (hex)|v2=icon=|v3=header=|v4=info=|v5=image=|v6=width=|block=1}}
;Parameters
{| class="wikitable"
! Parameter !! Description !! Default/Example
|-
| '''header''' (''Optional'')
| Sets the header text of the notice box.
| Default: ''Header text''
|-
| '''info''' (''Optional'')
| Adds additional information or content within the notice box.
| Default: ''Explanation''
|-
| '''image''' (''Optional'')
| Adds an image to the notice box, displayed on the left.
| Example: `image=Example.png`
|-
| '''tone''' (''Optional'')
| Specifies the color of the left border and background shade.
| Example: `tone=#8e44ad`
| Default: ''Green (#228b22)''
|-
| '''style''' (''Optional'')
| Additional inline CSS for custom styling.
| Example: `style=font-weight: bold;`
|}
<!--;Sample output
:<code><nowiki>{{Notice|header=Notice box|info=Does not use the {{Ambox}} template and could be considered a simpler alternative, since it doesn't have a CSS dependency.}}</nowiki></code>
::gives...
:{{Notice|header=Notice box|info=Does not use the <nowiki>{{Ambox}}</nowiki> template and could be considered a simpler alternative, since it doesn't have a CSS dependency.}}
-->
===with icon===
;''Sample Usage''
<pre>
{{Notice
| tone   = #8e44ad
| icon   = <i class="fas fa-cog fa-spin"></i>
| header = Notice Box Example
| info   = This is a simple and lightweight notice box without dependencies like {{T|Ambox}}.
| width  = 100%
}}
</pre>
;''Sample Output''
